      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5f07e5729e01594ca1838252",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "\"Gesture Locking\" is kind of a tough concept to implement for AV3, as you've got total control over when animations are turned on and off. If you want to turn an animation on and hold it, you may want to consider using a Toggle control in an AV3 avatar.\nThat being said, we've implemented Toggle Gesture as an action to bind in your SteamVR input configuration.\nNot changing status on this, as this doesn't directly address the post, but it may help with this issue.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
